OL,3,AActor Noel Clarke charged with sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Noel Clarke has been charged with
OL,7,Fsexual offences including sexual
OL,8,Fassault, voyeurism and exposure.
OL,10,FThe Crown Prosecution Service
OL,11,Fauthorised the Metropolitan Police to
OL,12,Fcharge the Doctor Who and Kidulthood
OL,13,Fstar on Wednesday, after a file of
OL,14,Fevidence was submitted by detectives.
OL,16,FClarke, 50, from Kensington, west
OL,17,FLondon, was charged with two counts of
OL,18,Fsexual assault, three charges of
OL,19,Fvoyeurism and one charge of exposure.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
